{"id":"e05c7a445ae4a4cd","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering.md","title":"Canonical Expressions and Base-13 Numbering","display":"df-smullyan-expression-numbering — Canonical Expressions and Base-13 Numbering","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering"],"display":"df-smullyan-expression-numbering — Canonical Expressions and Base-13 Numbering","source":"第 II 章 p. 23（PDF 40）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]]","[[92-df-smullyan-concatenation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-expression-numbering — Canonical Expressions and Base-13 Numbering"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 p. 23（PDF 40）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"647ecd31b33462bf\" href=\"?note=647ecd31b33462bf\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-alphabet\">92-df-smullyan-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e9af284cd2d6f1aa\" href=\"?note=e9af284cd2d6f1aa\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-concatenation\">92-df-smullyan-concatenation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_E,\\sigma_i\">\\(\\Sigma_E,\\sigma_i\\)</span> 采用原书字母表；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_E^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Sigma_E^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为有限串集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空串。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_E,g_E,E_n\">\\(E_E,g_E,E_n\\)</span> 为下文定义的规范表达式集合、编码与逆编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}expression\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\\quad\nE_E&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma_0\\}\\cup\n\\{s\\in\\Sigma_E^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus\\{\\epsilon\\}\\mid s\\text{ 的首字符不是 }\\sigma_0\\},\\\\\ng_E(\\sigma_{i_0}\\cdots\\sigma_{i_{k-1}})&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\sum_{j&lt;k}i_j13^{\\,k-1-j},\\\\\ng_E&amp;:E_E\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbb N,\\qquad E_n\\coloneqq g_E^{-1}(n),\\\\\n\\forall X,Y\\in E_E\\;(g_E(X)&gt;0&amp;\\Longrightarrow\nXY\\in E_E\\land g_E(XY)=g_E(X)*_{13}g_E(Y)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}expression\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\\quad\nE_E&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma_0\\}\\cup\n\\{s\\in\\Sigma_E^{&lt;\\omega}\\setminus\\{\\epsilon\\}\\mid s\\text{ 的首字符不是 }\\sigma_0\\},\\\\\ng_E(\\sigma_{i_0}\\cdots\\sigma_{i_{k-1}})&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\sum_{j&lt;k}i_j13^{\\,k-1-j},\\\\\ng_E&amp;:E_E\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbb N,\\qquad E_n\\coloneqq g_E^{-1}(n),\\\\\n\\forall X,Y\\in E_E\\;(g_E(X)&gt;0&amp;\\Longrightarrow\nXY\\in E_E\\land g_E(XY)=g_E(X)*_{13}g_E(Y)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非零自然数的规范十三进制位串给出唯一表达式，零只解码为单个 accent。不能把任意长度的全 accent 串同时列为码零的不同规范表达式，否则不再是双射。</p>\n<p>原书写下所有表达式均满足拼接等式，但其规范表达式约定在左因子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_0\">\\(E_0\\)</span> 时不封闭；这里把必要的正左码限制写出。后续 wrapper 的前缀非零，因此并不受这一边界影响。编码空串亦不在这套约定中。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 II 章 p. 23（PDF 40）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"647ecd31b33462bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-concatenation","status":"resolved","id":"e9af284cd2d6f1aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-concatenation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma_E,\\sigma_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_E^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"E_E,g_E,E_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}expression\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\\quad\nE_E&\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma_0\\}\\cup\n\\{s\\in\\Sigma_E^{<\\omega}\\setminus\\{\\epsilon\\}\\mid s\\text{ 的首字符不是 }\\sigma_0\\},\\\\\ng_E(\\sigma_{i_0}\\cdots\\sigma_{i_{k-1}})&\\coloneqq\n\\sum_{j<k}i_j13^{\\,k-1-j},\\\\\ng_E&:E_E\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbb N,\\qquad E_n\\coloneqq g_E^{-1}(n),\\\\\n\\forall X,Y\\in E_E\\;(g_E(X)>0&\\Longrightarrow\nXY\\in E_E\\land g_E(XY)=g_E(X)*_{13}g_E(Y)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"E_0","display":false}],"bytes":1807,"backlinks":[{"id":"c56ec2b54fc34fc6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本地 Expr 包含空串及所有有限串。原书用于一一编号的 expression 则排除空串和多余首 accent；精确版本见 [[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]]。两者不可直接共用逆解码。"},{"id":"2cf611da381080e0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"495bb24d4506a7c2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6deaff22ee062525","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6ba7593680ce3de6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]] → [[92-df-smullyan-concatenation]] → [[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]] → [[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-code]]。"},{"id":"640a7b260804a3a0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]]、[[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-170","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]]"}],"outgoing":["647ecd31b33462bf","e9af284cd2d6f1aa"]}